-- statement:
--   The definitions of the module `MIPRE.Background.Introspection.NumberedComplete` of the MIP\* = RE formalization (commit `70cbf1c` of vidick/MIPRE-formalization). Honest guarded quotient completeness with the actual register numbering. The source CL family remains on its given coordinate type. Only its honest construction is expressed temporarily in the binary Weyl coordinates. Quotient transport then returns the strategy to the original coordinates, with exact dimension and with support certificates for both kinds of executable guards.
--
